### Learning Platform API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000

### ============================================================================
### STEP 1: REGISTER & LOGIN (REAL DB INTEGRATION)
### ============================================================================

### Register Test Student
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "email": "student@learningplatform.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login Test Student (Copy the token from response)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@learningplatform.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Register Test Instructor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Instructor",
  "email": "instructor@learningplatform.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "instructor"
}

###

### Login Test Instructor (Copy the token from response)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "instructor@learningplatform.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### ============================================================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================================================

GET http://localhost:5000/
Content-Type: application/json

