### ============================================================================
### REVIEW MODULE
### ============================================================================

### Get Course Reviews (Public - No Auth Needed!)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/review/69fb0f2ce31e5c5cee116d19
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Submit Review (Requires Auth)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/review/69fb1002e31e5c5cee116d1a
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY5ZmIwMzQyNmFiZDM5YzA3NzA3Y2QzOCIsInJvbGUiOiJzdHVkZW50Iiwicm9sZXMiOlsic3R1ZGVudCJdLCJpYXQiOjE3NzgxMzA4NDAsImV4cCI6MTc3ODczNTY0MH0.hJU8DGdE8zOvNx5UMUTIKcCcoYmDD_ek6xfSe5Vsb-8

{
  "rating": 4,
  "review": "Excellent course! Very comprehensive and well-structured."
}

###

### ============================================================================
### INSTRUCTIONS - IMPORTANT!
### ============================================================================
###
### 1. **FIRST STEP**: Click "Send Request" for "Generate Test Student Token"
###    - Copy the "token" value from the response
###    - Replace all instances of REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_TEST_LOGIN with this token
###
### 2. **FOR QUIZ CREATION**: Click "Send Request" for "Generate Test Instructor Token"
###    - Copy the "token" value
###    - Replace REPLACE_WITH_INSTRUCTOR_TOKEN with this token
###
### 3. **FOR QUIZ ATTEMPTS**: 
###    - First create a quiz and copy its ID from response
###    - Replace QUIZ_ID_HERE with the actual quiz ID
###
### 4. **TESTING ORDER**:
###    Step 1: Generate Test Student Token
###    Step 2: Try "Get Course Reviews" (public endpoint - no token needed)
###    Step 3: Try "Get Progress Dashboard" (test your token)
###    Step 4: Try "Mark Lecture Complete"
###    Step 5: Try "Get Course Progress"
###    Step 6: Generate Test Instructor Token
###    Step 7: Create Quiz
###    Step 8: Get Quizzes and copy ID
###    Step 9: Attempt Quiz with that ID
###
### Happy Testing! 🚀